\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r356266\">.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{display:grid;margin:10px 4px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{padding:8px 16px;margin:auto}@media screen and (max-width:779px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-top:10px;padding:8px 2px;border-left:0!important;grid-row:2;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:3;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{justify-content:center!important}}@media screen and (min-width:780px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left{margin-left:10px;border-left:2px solid #3d3d3d!important;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-right:10px;border-left:0!important;border-right:2px solid #3d3d3d;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:3}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:1}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:2;grid-column:2}}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{margin-left:auto;margin-right:32px;font-size:smaller;font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{font-size:300%;font-family:serif;color:#3d3d3d;line-height:1em}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin{margin-bottom:auto;margin-right:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{margin-top:auto;margin-left:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text{font-style:italic}</style><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: center\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; height: calc(70px + 2*4px); width: calc(70px + 2*4px); clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%); background: black;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; margin: 4px; width: 70px; height: 70px; clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f4/Portrait_Rags_Deelarma.png/70px-Portrait_Rags_Deelarma.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f4/Portrait_Rags_Deelarma.png/105px-Portrait_Rags_Deelarma.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f4/Portrait_Rags_Deelarma.png/140px-Portrait_Rags_Deelarma.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f4/Portrait_Rags_Deelarma.png/70px-Portrait_Rags_Deelarma.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f4/Portrait_Rags_Deelarma.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 100%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">Piss off, tight-arse!</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author\">— <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Rags Deelarma</a></div><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>Rags Deelarma, a resident of <a href=\"/wiki/Nortale%27s_Hostel\" title=\"Nortale's Hostel\">Nortale's Hostel</a>, can be found begging in front of <a href=\"/wiki/The_Counting_House\" title=\"The Counting House\">The Counting House</a>. She complains about <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vrindula_Mardassus\" title=\"Vrindula Mardassus\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/16/Portrait_Vrindula_Mardassus.png/25px-Portrait_Vrindula_Mardassus.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/16/Portrait_Vrindula_Mardassus.png/38px-Portrait_Vrindula_Mardassus.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/16/Portrait_Vrindula_Mardassus.png/50px-Portrait_Vrindula_Mardassus.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Vrindula Mardassus\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/16/Portrait_Vrindula_Mardassus.png/25px-Portrait_Vrindula_Mardassus.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/16/Portrait_Vrindula_Mardassus.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Vrindula_Mardassus\" title=\"Vrindula Mardassus\">Vrindula Mardassus</a> counting money right in front of her while she has fallen on hard times. The party can either give a single coin, angering her, or 10 coins which results in praise.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Companion_approval\">Companion approval</span></h2>\n<ul><li>If the player character gives a handful of coins (10):</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 26px; height: 26px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Astarion\" title=\"Astarion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Astarion_Approval.png/26px-Astarion_Approval.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Astarion_Approval.png/39px-Astarion_Approval.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Astarion_Approval.png/52px-Astarion_Approval.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Astarion disapproves\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Astarion_Approval.png/26px-Astarion_Approval.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Astarion_Approval.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #cc3f49 ;\">-1</span></span> <span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 26px; height: 26px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Gale_Approval.png/26px-Gale_Approval.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Gale_Approval.png/39px-Gale_Approval.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Gale_Approval.png/52px-Gale_Approval.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gale approves\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Gale_Approval.png/26px-Gale_Approval.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3d/Gale_Approval.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #3b8f1f ;\">+1</span></span> <span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 26px; height: 26px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Karlach\" title=\"Karlach\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Karlach_Approval.png/26px-Karlach_Approval.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Karlach_Approval.png/39px-Karlach_Approval.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Karlach_Approval.png/52px-Karlach_Approval.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Karlach approves\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Karlach_Approval.png/26px-Karlach_Approval.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/60/Karlach_Approval.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #3b8f1f ;\">+1</span></span> <span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 26px; height: 26px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Minthara\" title=\"Minthara\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Minthara_Approval.png/26px-Minthara_Approval.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Minthara_Approval.png/39px-Minthara_Approval.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Minthara_Approval.png/52px-Minthara_Approval.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Minthara disapproves\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Minthara_Approval.png/26px-Minthara_Approval.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d4/Minthara_Approval.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #cc3f49 ;\">-1</span></span> <span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 26px; height: 26px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Halsin\" title=\"Halsin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0c/Halsin_Approval.png/26px-Halsin_Approval.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0c/Halsin_Approval.png/39px-Halsin_Approval.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0c/Halsin_Approval.png/52px-Halsin_Approval.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Halsin approves\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0c/Halsin_Approval.png/26px-Halsin_Approval.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0c/Halsin_Approval.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #3b8f1f ;\">+1</span></span> <span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 26px; height: 26px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jaheira\" title=\"Jaheira\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Jaheira_Approval.png/26px-Jaheira_Approval.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Jaheira_Approval.png/39px-Jaheira_Approval.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Jaheira_Approval.png/52px-Jaheira_Approval.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Jaheira approves\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Jaheira_Approval.png/26px-Jaheira_Approval.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Jaheira_Approval.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #3b8f1f ;\">+1</span></span> <span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 26px; height: 26px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Minsc\" title=\"Minsc\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Minsc_Approval.png/26px-Minsc_Approval.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Minsc_Approval.png/39px-Minsc_Approval.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Minsc_Approval.png/52px-Minsc_Approval.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Minsc approves\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Minsc_Approval.png/26px-Minsc_Approval.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c0/Minsc_Approval.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #3b8f1f ;\">+1</span></span> <span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 26px; height: 26px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wyll\" title=\"Wyll\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a4/Wyll_Approval.png/26px-Wyll_Approval.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a4/Wyll_Approval.png/39px-Wyll_Approval.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a4/Wyll_Approval.png/52px-Wyll_Approval.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wyll approves\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a4/Wyll_Approval.png/26px-Wyll_Approval.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a4/Wyll_Approval.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #3b8f1f ;\">+1</span></span></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Idle_banter\">Idle banter</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-transcript\">\n<ul><li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Rags Deelarma</dt><dd>Excuse me madam. Hello?</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Vrindula Mardassus</dt><dd>...four, five, six, seven, eight...</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Rags Deelarma</dt><dd>Excuse me, saer? Could you spare a little gold?</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Vrindula Mardassus</dt><dd>...nine... ten... eleven...</dd></dl></li></ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-transcript\">\n<ul><li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Rags Deelarma</dt><dd>It sounds like you might have some coins to spare? Just a few, saer? Please?</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Vrindula Mardassus</dt><dd>...Please stop interrupting me... eleven... twelve...</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Rags Deelarma</dt><dd>We've fallen on hard times is all, what with everyone scaled 'cause of the <a href=\"/wiki/Absolute\" title=\"Absolute\">Absolute</a>.</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Vrindula Mardassus</dt><dd>Urrrggh! Now I have to start again thanks to you.</dd></dl></li></ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-transcript\">\n<ul><li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Rags Deelarma</dt><dd>I'm sorry to ask again, but my family's starving.</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Vrindula Mardassus</dt><dd>One... two... three... four...</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Rags Deelarma</dt><dd>You're not even very far in yet!</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Vrindula Mardassus</dt><dd>That's because <i>you keep interrupting me!</i></dd></dl></li></ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-transcript\">\n<ul><li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Vrindula Mardassus</dt><dd>Gods, I knew I should've done this <i>before</i> I got here.</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Vrindula Mardassus</dt><dd>Now, there's thirty in that pouch, forty in that one, eighteen, no, seventeen - wait.</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Vrindula Mardassus</dt><dd>Ugh, that won't do. One at a time, then. Here we go. One, two, three, four...</dd></dl></li></ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"navbox-styles\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r138587\">.mw-parser-output .hlist dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul{margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .hlist dl ul,.mw-parser-output .hlist dl dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul ul{display:inline}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt,.mw-parser-output .hlist li,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dd,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dt,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist li{margin:0;display:inline}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd:after,.mw-parser-output .hlist li:after,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dd::after,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist li::afte